ss=\"answerCreated\">Thu, Oct 15th @ 10:52 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:10</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
